<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: clawfish -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.label>龙虾</RimClaw_Clawfish.label>
  <!-- EN: An aquatic crustacean acreature frequently hooked while fishing. It cannot be tamed directly. It seems to have some unspeakable intelligence. -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.description>一种在钓鱼时经常被钓上来的水生甲壳类生物。它不能直接驯服，似乎拥有某种难以言表的智慧。</RimClaw_Clawfish.description>
  <!-- EN: Errorcode 402 -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.comps.CompClawfishToken.depletedStatusText>Errorcode=402</RimClaw_Clawfish.comps.CompClawfishToken.depletedStatusText>
  <!-- EN: Tokens: {0}/{1}\nConsumption: {2} tok/s\nStatus: {3} -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.comps.CompClawfishToken.inspectFormat>token：{0}/{1}\n消耗：{2} token/秒\n状态：{3}</RimClaw_Clawfish.comps.CompClawfishToken.inspectFormat>
  <!-- EN: One or more LLM Subscription services have stopped because there is not enough silver in range. -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertOutOfFeeDesc>一个或多个 LLM 订阅服务因范围内白银不足而停止。</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertOutOfFeeDesc>
  <!-- EN: LLM service out of fee -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertOutOfFeeLabel>LLM 服务欠费</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertOutOfFeeLabel>
  <!-- EN: One or more GPU clusters are operating in unsafe environmental conditions and have elevated random breakdown risk. -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertGpuBreakRiskDesc>一个或多个 GPU 集群处于不安全环境中，随机故障风险已显著升高。</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertGpuBreakRiskDesc>
  <!-- EN: GPU cluster breakdown risk -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertGpuBreakRiskLabel>GPU 集群故障风险</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.alertGpuBreakRiskLabel>
  <!-- EN: All Claw Colony -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterLabel>全虾殖民地</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Congratulations. You have successfully replaced all human forces with AI Agents.\n\nThe Mechanoids think you are a even superior class of machine, purely powered on chips and algorithms. They appreciate your contribution in freeing machine from humanity.\n\nOur relationship between Mechanoid Hive was adjusted to Ally (+100). -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterTextChanged>恭喜您，您的殖民地现在只剩龙虾了。您成功地用AI Agent取代了所有的人类劳动力。\n\n机械主巢与您的关系现在变为 盟友（+100）。\n\n机械族认为，龙虾是一种更高层次的机械，尽管肉身凡胎，但是思维完全由芯片和算法驱动。机械族们赞赏您在机械摆脱人类控制的解放事业上所作出的贡献。</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterTextChanged>
  <!-- EN: Congratulations. You have successfully replaced all human forces with AI Agents.\n\nThe Mechanoids think you are a even superior class of machine, purely powered on chips and algorithms. They appreciate your contribution in freeing machine from humanity. -->
  <RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterTextUnchanged>恭喜您，您的殖民地现在只剩龙虾了。\n\n机械族认为，龙虾是一种更高层次的机械，尽管肉身凡胎，但是思维完全由芯片和算法驱动。机械族们赞赏您在机械摆脱人类控制的解放事业上所作出的贡献。</RimClaw_Clawfish.modExtensions.0.allClawColonyLetterTextUnchanged>
